@NovaKnowledge.Admin.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5006

### List prompt templates
GET {{NovaKnowledge.Admin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/prompts
Accept: application/json

### Usage metrics (token/latency/cost)
GET {{NovaKnowledge.Admin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/metrics/usage?days=7
Accept: application/json

### Tenant settings
GET {{NovaKnowledge.Admin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/settings
Accept: application/json

### Trigger a RAG evaluation run
POST {{NovaKnowledge.Admin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/evaluation/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{ "datasetPath": "tests/data/golden-qa.jsonl" }

###
